# Firebase config (must not be committed)
google-services.json

# JVM heap dumps. The Gradle build runs with -XX:+HeapDumpOnOutOfMemoryError, so
# an OOM writes a file here that can be over a gigabyte — far past GitHub's
# 100 MB limit, and it will be swept up by `git add -A` if it is not ignored.
*.hprof
